nistration\">National Archives and Records Administration (NARA)</a>.<br><br>\n<p>This file is a 200 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dots_per_inch\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Dots per inch\">dpi</a> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Contact_print#Proof_sheets\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Contact print\">photo contact sheet</a> having images from <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/roll_film\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:roll film\">roll of film</a> B0160 of the <i>August 9, 1974 - January 20, 1977 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gerald_R._Ford\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Gerald R. Ford\">Gerald R. Ford</a> White House Photographic Office Series A0001-A9999 and B0001-B2886 photographs.</i> <br><br>\n</p>\nThe date on the photo contact sheet is the date the roll of film was processed, not necessarily the date the photographs were taken. See <a href=\"#Table\">table</a> below for additional details.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1976-06-09","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gerald_R._Ford_Presidential_Library\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Gerald R. Ford Presidential Library\">Gerald R. Ford Presidential Library</a>, Image: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/library/whphotos/B0160_NLGRF.jpg\" href=\"https://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/library/whphotos/B0160_NLGRF.jpg\">B0160_NLGRF.jpg</a> from <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/library/whphotos/19760609whpo.pdf\" href=\"https://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/library/whphotos/19760609whpo.pdf\">White House Photographs, June 9, 1976</a> of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/Library/whphotos/whpo.asp\" href=\"https://www.fordlibrarymuseum.gov/Library/whphotos/whpo.asp\">White House Photographic Collection page</a>","source":"co